## Route block template — Layout Responsive (`layout`)

Copy one block per route. Be concrete: regions, order, what is hidden, where the primary CTA sits.

```
### <route path> — <Page name>
- Role / access: <who>
- Purpose (one primary job): <what the user does here>
- Layout concept: <pattern name + why it is the recommended fit>
- Mobile (<768): <regions top→bottom, nav, primary CTA position, sheets/drawers>
- Tablet (768–1023): <columns/panes, nav, what appears that mobile hid>
- Desktop (≥1024): <columns/panes, sidebar/top bar, density, hover/keyboard extras>
- Table / list handling: <mobile card list · tablet condensed table + drawer · desktop full table> (if the page has tabular data)
- States: <loading skeleton shape · empty · error>
- Notes: <sticky elements, infinite scroll vs pagination, safe-area, motion>
```

## Route block template — Normal Responsive (`normal`)

```
### <route path> — <Page name>
- Role / access: <who>
- Purpose (one primary job): <…>
- Layout concept: <single composition + why>
- Reflow: <columns at base / md / lg; what stacks; what hides or collapses>
- Nav: <navbar → menu button at what width>
- Table / list handling: <horizontal scroll with sticky first column, or stacked rows> (if tabular data)
- States: <loading skeleton shape · empty · error>
```

